---
// First paint of the product: what PrintoKids is for, and the control the parent
// will press. The button stays inert until S-01 wires up maze generation.
---

<main class="flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[#F6F1E8] px-6 py-20 text-[#3F3A34]">
  <div class="flex w-full max-w-xl flex-col items-center gap-10 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">PrintoKids</h1>

    <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#5B554C] sm:text-xl">Wygeneruj labirynt i wydrukuj go na kartce A4.</p>

    <button
      type="button"
      disabled
      class="cursor-not-allowed rounded-full bg-[#9FAD95] px-12 py-3.5 text-lg font-medium text-[#3F3A34] select-none"
    >
      Generuj
    </button>
  </div>
</main>
